WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.040
Now six hours will pass in a few
seconds.

00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:09.307
Every star circles Polaris, once in
23 hours 56 minutes.

00:00:09.757 --> 00:00:12.462
None of them rises, and none of them
sets.

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:17.341
From the pole, the stars above the
horizon are up all year, and the rest

00:00:17.341 --> 00:00:18.264
are never seen.
